       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. RECEXPL.

       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-QTY             PIC 9(4) VALUE 0.
       01  WS-DISCOUNT-CODE   PIC 9(4) VALUE 0.
       01  WS-NET-TOTAL       PIC 9(4) VALUE 0.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       CALC-TOTALS.
           CALL "DISCOUNT" USING WS-DISCOUNT-CODE.
           COMPUTE WS-NET-TOTAL = WS-QTY * 2.
